        {
          "text": "NIKAN 尼堪, d. 1660, was a member of the Nara clan in the Ula (Sungari River) district. He joined the service of Nurhaci [q. v.] sometime after the defeat of the Ula in 1613 (see Bujantai), and was attached to the Bordered White Banner.",
          "source": "eccp-3649158",
          "kind": "source-wording",
          "status": "imported"
